{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Moon, little girl waking up in a nightmare, scary shadows surrounding you. With the help of an talking ball of light, you must solve puzzles to get rid of nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light it up!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your flashlight is you best friend. No really - you literally have a friend in there. &quot;Light&quot; makes your flashlight like no other, making it able to banish shadows, activate objects and collect star shards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles to move forward</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your flashlight and objects around you to find a way through Moons dream. Push and carry objects in correct places, in correct order, and find different ways to use your light.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dreamlike world, starlight as your guide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find light in the darkest corners of childhood bedroom, twisted with imagination and fear. Immerse yourself in Moons dream through nostalgia, atmospheric audio and beautiful, handcrafted visuals.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713490?t=1748257510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713490/eeaf4460c5969cefaf8112098dd860d862051099/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748257510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713490/3e42fa51d909bb729059f0647cfb0af253452610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748257510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713490/3e42fa51d909bb729059f0647cfb0af253452610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748257510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Moon, little girl waking up in a nightmare, scary shadows surrounding you. With the help of an talking ball of light, you must solve puzzles to get rid of nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light it up!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your flashlight is you best friend. No really - you literally have a friend in there. &quot;Light&quot; makes your flashlight like no other, making it able to banish shadows, activate objects and collect star shards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles to move forward</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your flashlight and objects around you to find a way through Moons dream. Push and carry objects in correct places, in correct order, and find different ways to use your light.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dreamlike world, starlight as your guide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find light in the darkest corners of childhood bedroom, twisted with imagination and fear. Immerse yourself in Moons dream through nostalgia, atmospheric audio and beautiful, handcrafted visuals.</p>","developers":["Please go to Sleep, This is not Healthy Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713490/bf40f3d3b253675d720fbd7cb4c6511d6bd30972/header.jpg?t=1748257510","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb